` の `V/E/F/S/H` を参照していない。これでは Euler-Poincaré 検証にならない。\\\"\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:2333:    suggestion: \\\"この変更を意図的な winding 修正として明記し、`T08` を『counts は維持するが indices / STL facet normal は変わり得る』前提に更新するか、先に cuboid 側の loop orientation を正規化して本当に不変にすること。\\\"\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:2336:    section: \\\"テスト計画 > T03\\\"\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:2337:    finding: \\\"T03 の期待結果が `assert_eq!(2-3+3, 2)` 相当になっており、生成した `Solid` の `V/E/F/S/H` を参照していない。これでは Euler-Poincaré 検証にならない。\\\"\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:51:// T01: normal box\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:53:async fn t01_normal_box() {\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:66:// T02: normal cylinder\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:68:async fn t02_normal_cylinder() {\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:81:// T03: determinism\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:83:async fn t03_determinism() {\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:101:// T04: 404 not found\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:103:async fn t04_not_found() {\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:111:// T05: 400 non-.mycad extension\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:113:async fn t05_invalid_extension() {\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:137:// T06: 403 Host header (DNS rebinding protection)\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:139:async fn t06_host_header_rebinding() {\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:152:// T07: 422 unsupported feature (sphere)\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:154:async fn t07_unsupported_feature() {\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:163:// T08: 422 degenerate dimension (zero-width box)\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:165:async fn t08_degenerate_dimension() {\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:174:// T09: 422 assembly unsupported\\ncrates/mycad-api/tests/mesh_api.rs:176:async fn t09_assembly_unsupported() {\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md:12:    finding: \\\"TS drift check は tracked な `web/src/generated/*` が 1 つも無いと丸ごと skip するが、現状その生成物自体が untracked のままなので、T06/T07 の成果物なしで CI が green になってしまう。\\\"\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md:18:    finding: \\\"`test_ts_derive_backward_compat` の exact golden は `simple_box.mycad` だけで、`cylinder.mycad` と `assembly.mycad` は変更後 YAML の roundtrip (`yaml1 == yaml2`) しか見ていない。これでは T08 の『examples/*.mycad の wire YAML が不変』を満たせず、他 fixture の serde 回帰を取りこぼす。\\\"\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md:19:    suggestion: \\\"各 example について `to_yaml()` を fixture 本文または個別 golden と比較し、全 `.mycad` で byte-identical を固定する。\\\"\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md:24:    finding: \\\"`t06_gen_ts_produces_all_files` は `gen_ts()` / `cargo xtask gen-ts` を通さず temp dir への直接 export しか確認していない。`workspace_root()`、`web/src/generated` の掃除、実 CLI 経路が壊れてもこのテスト群では検出できない。\\\"\\nfeatures/20-ts-frontend-skeleton/design-review.md.log:45:- golden YAML ラウンドトリップテストがあるか\\nfeatures/20-ts-frontend-skeleton/design-review.md.log:56:```yaml\\nfeatures/20-ts-frontend-skeleton/design-review.md.log:121:| T01 | ビルド | `npx tsc --noEmit` (strict) | exit 0 |\\nfeatures/20-ts-frontend-skeleton/design-review.md.log:122:| T02 | ビルド | `npx vite build` で `web/dist` 生成 | exit 0 |\\nfeatures/20-ts-frontend-skeleton/design-review.md.log:123:| T03 | 型整合 | `api.ts` が生成型を import し型エラー無し | tsc 0 |\\nfeatures/20-ts-frontend-skeleton/design-review.md.log:124:| T04 | xtask | `cargo xtask ci` が web ステップ込みで green | exit 0 |\\nfeatures/20-ts-frontend-skeleton/design-review.md.log:125:| T05 | drift | ci 実行後 `web/src/generated` に git 差分が出ない | drift 無し |\\nfeatures/20-ts-frontend-skeleton/design-review.md.log:126:| T06 | xtask skip | PATH から node を外すと web ステップを警告 skip し pass | exit 0 |\\nfeatures/20-ts-frontend-skeleton/design-review.md.log:127:| T07 (手動) | orbit | ブラウザで `simple_box` が回転/ズーム/パン | 目視 |\\nfeatures/20-ts-frontend-skeleton/design-review.md.log:128:| T08 (手動) | エラー UI | file 未指定 / 不正パスで `error` 表示 | 目視 |\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:29: crates/mycad-kernel/tests/cuboid_roundtrip.rs  |   4 +-\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:49:    - examples/cylinder.mycad + T01-T15 test suite (32 tests green)\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:484:     fn assert_uv_roundtrip(surface: &Surface, u: f64, v: f64) {\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:492:     fn test_uv_of_roundtrip_plane() {\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:499:         assert_uv_roundtrip(&surface, 0.7, -1.3);\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:503:     fn test_uv_of_roundtrip_cylinder() {\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:509:         assert_uv_roundtrip(&surface, 0.9, 1.7);\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:513:     fn test_uv_of_roundtrip_sphere() {\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:518:         assert_uv_roundtrip(&surface, 1.1, 0.6);\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:522:     fn test_uv_of_roundtrip_cone() {\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:528:         assert_uv_roundtrip(&surface, 0.8, 2.0);\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:695:+    /// T01: Determinism — identical inputs produce identical solids (field-by-field).\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:723:+    /// T02: Topology counts.\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:742:+    /// T03: Euler–Poincaré formula V - E + F = 2(S - H), S=1, H=0 → 2.\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:761:+    /// T04: Manifold condition — each edge referenced by exactly 2 HEs with opposite orientation,\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:816:+    /// T05: Geometry — seam vertices and surface coefficients.\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:1279:+    /// T06: Normal tessellation — triangle count for cylinder with default 32 angular segments.\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:1298:+    /// T07: Determinism — same input → same output.\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:1315:+    /// T08: Regression — cuboid tessellation is byte-identical to pre-cylinder output.\\nfeatures/12-cylinder/final-review.md:1328:+    /// T08 extended: exact positions and indices snapshot.\\nfeatures/12-cyli