i-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1272:    /// T02: Topology counts.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6182:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2955:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1938:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1291:    /// T03: Euler–Poincaré formula V - E + F = 2(S - H), S=1, H=0 → 2.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6183:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2956:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1939:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1310:    /// T04: Manifold condition — each edge referenced by exactly 2 HEs with opposite orientation,\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6184:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2957:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1940:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1363:    /// T07: Determinism — same input → same output.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6185:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2958:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1941:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1380:    /// T08: Regression — cuboid tessellation is byte-identical to pre-cylinder output.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6186:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2959:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1944:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1393:    /// T08 extended: exact positions and indices snapshot.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6187:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2960:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1948:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1410:    /// T09: Outward normals — all facet normals point away from centroid.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6188:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2963:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1960:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1882:    section