_eq!` |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6330:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3198:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2645:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:1104:./features/12-cylinder/design-review-3.md:201:| T08 | 回帰(平面バイト不変) | `make_cuboid` の `tessellate_solid` が従来どおり 12三角形/24頂点/36 index。**positions も indices も従来値と完全一致**（スワップ撤去によりバイト不変、R02）。cuboid は逆向き Line HE を含むため R01 の向き対応も同時に担保 | 既存テスト維持 + positions/indices 一致 |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6331:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3199:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2646:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:1105:./features/12-cylinder/design-review-3.md:203:| T10 | ディスパッチ統合 | `examples/cylinder.mycad` を `build_solid_from_features` でビルドし T02 と同じ counts | `feature_dispatcher.rs` |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6332:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3207:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2701:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:1316:./features/12-cylinder/final-review.md:742:+    /// T03: Euler–Poincaré formula V - E + F = 2(S - H), S=1, H=0 → 2.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6333:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3208:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2716:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:1414:./features/12-cylinder/final-review.md:2050:    /// T03: Euler–Poincaré formula V - E + F = 2(S - H), S=1, H=0 → 2.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6334:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3209:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2756:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:1684:./features/18-api-skeleton/design-review.md:146:| T01 | 正常系 | `GET /api/v0/mesh?file=examples/simple_box.mycad` を oneshot で叩く | 200、body を `TriangleMesh` に deser でき `positions`/`indices` が非空、`indices.len() % 3 == 0` |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:633