E + F = 2(S - H), S=1, H=0 → 2.\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6641:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3726:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3526:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2079:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:2834:    /// T01: Determinism — identical inputs produce identical solids (field-by-field).\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6642:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3727:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3527:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2080:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:2862:    /// T02: Topology counts.\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6643:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3728:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3528:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2081:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:2881:    /// T03: Euler–Poincaré formula V - E + F = 2(S - H), S=1, H=0 → 2.\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6644:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3729:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3529:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2082:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:2900:    /// T04: Manifold condition — each edge referenced by exactly 2 HEs with opposite orientation,\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6645:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3730:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3530:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2083:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:2955:    /// T05: Geometry — seam vertices and surface coefficients.\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6646:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3731:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3531:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2087:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:3913:    /// T06: Normal tessellation — triangle count for cylinder with default 32 angular segments.\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6647:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3732:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3532:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2088:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:3932:    /// T07: Determinism — same input → same output.\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6648:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3733:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3533:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2089:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:3949:    /// T08: Regression — cuboid tessellation is byte-identical to pre-cylinder output.\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6649:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3734:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3534:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2090:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:3962:    /// T08 extended: exact positions and indices snapshot.\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6650:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3735:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3535:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2091:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:3979:    /// T09: Outward normals — all facet normals point away from centroid.\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6651:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3738:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3538:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2095:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:4720:    finding: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`build_solid_from_features(&doc.root_component.features, ...)` の再利用方針と T09 の `EmptyFeatureList` 期待値では、`children` / `ref` を持つ assembly/reference 文書と、本当に feature が空の不正 part 文書を区別できない。これでは文書自身が要求している『assembly は明確なエラー + 422』を満たせない。\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6652:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3741:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3541:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2098:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:4745:    finding: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"`build_solid_from_features(&doc.root_component.features, ...)` の再利用方針と T09 の `EmptyFeatureList` 期待値では、`children` / `ref` を持つ assembly/reference 文書と、本当に feature が空の不正 part 文書を区別できない。これでは文書自身が要求している『assembly は明確なエラー + 422』を満たせない。\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6653:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3744:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3544:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2102:2026-05-25T06:37:27.352616Z ERROR codex_core::tools::router: error=exec_command failed for `/bin/bash -lc 'RUSTC_WRAPPER= CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/mycad-target cargo test -p mycad-kernel --no-run'`: SandboxDenied { message: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"error: Read-only file system (os error 30) at path \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/tmp/mycad-targetWKXIcx\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", output: ExecToolCallOutput { exit_code: 101, stdout: StreamOutput { text: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", truncated_after_lines: None }, stderr: StreamOutput { text: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"error: Read-only file system (os error 30) at path \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/tmp/mycad-targetWKXIcx\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", truncated_after_lines: None }, aggregated_output: StreamOutput { text: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"error: Read-only file system (os error 30) at path \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/tmp/mycad-targetWKXIcx\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", truncated_after_lines: None }, duration: 0ns, timed_out: false } }\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6654:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3745:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3545:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2103:2026-05-25T06:37:27.390183Z ERROR codex_core::tools::router: error=exec_command failed for `/bin/bash -lc 'RUSTC_WRAPPER= CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/mycad-target cargo test -p mycad-api --no-run'`: SandboxDenied { message: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"error: Read-only file system (os error 30) at path \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/tmp/mycad-targetWmMi9p\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", output: ExecToolCallOutput { exit_code: 101, stdout: StreamOutput { text: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", truncated_after_lines: None }, stderr: StreamOutput { text: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"error: Read-only file system (os error 30) at path \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/tmp/mycad-targetWmMi9p\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", truncated_after_lines: None }, aggregated_output: StreamOutput { text: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"error: Read-only file system (os error 30) at path \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/tmp/mycad-targetWmMi9p\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\", truncated_after_lines: None }, duration: 0ns, timed_out: false } }\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6655:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3746:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3546:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2121:> Codex 設計レビュー round 1-3 反映済み(3回上限)。round3 残存指摘は全て受諾し最終修正済み: R01=絶対パスのみ受理(決定的)、R02=v0 専用テッセレーション定数で Default 依存排除、R03=InvalidReference→422、R04=T09/T10 で assembly と空 part を分離、R05=K01 に INFINITY 分岐追加。round3 の verdict は fail のままだが指摘内容は本改訂で解消済み(ユーザー判断で再レビューせず確定)。\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6656:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3748:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3551:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2219:| T01 | 正常系(box) | `GET /api/v0/mesh?file=<abs>/examples/simple_box.mycad` を oneshot | 200、`TriangleMesh` deser 可、`positions`/`indices` 非空、`indices.len() % 3 == 0` |\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6657:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3749:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3552:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2220:| T02 | 正常系(cylinder)(R05) | 同上 `examples/cylinder.mycad`(周期面経路) | 200、mesh 非空 |\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6658:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3750:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3553:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2221:| T03 | 決定性 | T01/T02 を 2 回実行 | 返る JSON バイト列が完全一致 |\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6659:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3751:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3554:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2222:| T04 | 404 | 存在しない `file` | 404、body `{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"error\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\": ...}` |\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6660:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3752:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3555:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2223:| T05 | 400 | 非 `.mycad` 拡張子(`Cargo.toml`) | 400(InvalidExtension) |\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6661:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3753:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3556:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2224:| T06 | 403 | `Host: evil.com` | 403(Host 検証) |\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6662:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3754:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3557:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2225:| T07 | 422 未対応 feature(R03) | fixture `create_sphere` 単一 feature | 422(UnsupportedFeature) |\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6663:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3755:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3558:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2226:| T08 | 422 退化寸法(R02) | fixture `create_box` width=0(または負値) | 422(InvalidParameter) |\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6664:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3756:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3559:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2227:| T09 | 422 assembly 非対応(R04) | fixture: root features 空 + children あり | 422、body に assembly/reference 専用メッセージ(空 part とは別経路) |\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6665:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3758:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3564:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2237:> **R04 反論**(round 2): 新規 `crates/mycad-api/tests/fixtures/*.mycad` は T07-T09 で API 経由で必ずパースされる(パースできなければ期待する 422 が出ず test fail)ため、入力形状の妥当性は API テストで担保済み。`Document` の YAML roundtrip 安定性は `mycad-format` の既存 roundtrip テストが所有。クロスクレートの roundtrip 追加は「テストは所有クレートに置く」規約に反するため行わない。fixture は最小に保つ。\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6666:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3759:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3565:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2301:- 設計レビュー時に合意したテスト計画（ID T01〜）が全て実装されているか\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6667:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3768:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3581:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2703:| T01 | 正常系(box) | `GET /api/v0/mesh?file=<abs>/examples/simple_box.mycad` を oneshot | 200、`TriangleMesh` deser 可、`positions`/`indices` 非空、`indices.len() % 3 == 0` |\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6668:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3769:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3582:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2704:| T02 | 正常系(cylinder)(R05) | 同上 `examples/cylinder.mycad`(周期面経路) | 200、mesh 非空 |\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6669:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3770:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3583:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:2705:| T03 | 決定性 | T01/T02 を 2 回実行 | 返る JSON バイト列が完全一致 |\\\\\\\\nfeatures/19-r